    "title": "What time does 'Daredevil: Born Again' season 2 drop to Disney+?",
    "text": "March 24, 2026, 4:37 p.m. ETGet ready, Marvel fans! The \"man without fear\" will soon return to a TV screen near you.Season 2 of \"Daredevil: Born Again\" will premiere this week, more than a decade after the original television series \"Daredevil\" aired on Netflix. According to USA TODAY, the \"Daredevil\" reboot follows Matt Murdock (Charlie Cox), a blind lawyer who not only fights for justice in court but also uses his heightened abilities to fight New York City crime by night.The new season, however, centers on the escalating conflict between Murdock and his longtime adversary Wilson Fisk (Vincent D'Onofrio), also known as Kingpin, a former mob boss who decides to pursue political office as the newly elected mayor.Here's everything to know about season 2 of \"Daredevil: Born Again,\" including how to watch.When does 'Daredevil: Born Again' season 2 come out?The season 2 premiere of \"Daredevil: Born Again\" will air on Tuesday, March 24.What time does 'Daredevil: Born Again' season 2 premiere?\"Daredevil: Born Again\" season 2 will premiere on Disney+ at 9 p.m. ET.Where to watch 'Daredevil: Born Again'Season 2 of \"Daredevil: Born Again\" is available to stream exclusively on Disney+, per Forbes.How many episodes are in 'Daredevil: Born Again' season 2?The second season of \"Daredevil: Born Again\" has 8 episodes, per the Bergen Record.Is 'Daredevil: Born Again' season 2 weekly?Yes, new episodes of \"Daredevil: Born Again\" will drop weekly on Tuesdays, with the season finale slated for May 5. People reports that a special presentation episode will also air on May 12.'Daredevil: Born Again' season 2 release scheduleEpisode 1: March 24.Episode 2: March 31.Episode 3: April 7.Episode 4: April 14.Episode 5: April 21.Episode 6: April 28.Episode 7: May 5.Episode 8: May 12 (\"A Marvel Television Special Presentation: The Punisher: One Last Kill\").'Daredevil: Born Again' season 2 castHere's a look at the cast of \"Daredevil: Born Again\" season 2, according to Forbes.Charlie Cox as Matt Murdock / Daredevil.Vincent D’Onofrio as Wilson Fisk / Kingpin.Krysten Ritter as Jessica Jones.Deborah Ann Woll as Karen Page.Elden Henson as Foggy Nelson.Ayelet Zurer as Vanessa Fisk.Wilson Bethel as Benjamin “Dex” Poindexter / Bullseye.Margarita Levieva as Dr. Heather Glenn.Nikki M. James as Kirsten McDuffie.Genneya Walton as BB Urich.Michael Gandolfini as Daniel Blake.Clark Johnson as Cherry.Camila Rodriguez as Angela Del Toro.The new season will also include Matthew Lillard and Lili Taylor, according to TV Guide.Is the Punisher in 'Daredevil: Born Again' season 2?According to Screen Rant, D'Onofrio said, in response to a fan on X, that Jon Bernthal won't return as the Punisher in season 2 of the series because the actor was \"busy\" starring in a Disney+ television special and \"Spider-Man: Brand New Day.\"However, the site adds that the Punisher's story, which left off with his escape from the Fisk's Anti-Vigilante Task Force, will continue with an hour-long Disney+ special, titled \"Punisher: One Last Kill,\" on May 12.When does 'Punisher: One Last Kill' come out?“Punisher: One Last Kill” is scheduled to air on May 12, one week after the “Daredevil: Born Again” Season 2 finale on May 5, Variety writes.",
